# Phase 27 plan 03 fixture (D-35): tmux server restart cycle.
# Greeting block, then two back-to-back structural events — they must
# coalesce into exactly ONE debounced list-panes re-poll. The 400ms pause
# lets the ~250ms debounce fire before %exit ends the stream; the
# supervisor must then re-attach with an epoch bump and capped backoff.
<< %begin 1700000000 1 0
<< %end 1700000000 1 0
<< %window-add @4
<< %window-renamed @4 build
@delay 400ms
<< %exit
